value":", failed queries will not retry by default. If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", failed queries will retry infinitely. If set to an integer number, e.g. 3, failed queries will retry until the failed query count meets that number. If set to a function "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(failureCount, error) => boolean"},{"type":"text","value":" failed queries will retry until the function returns false. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"3"},{"type":"text","value":" on the client and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"0"},{"type":"text","value":" on the server."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"injectInfiniteQueryFn-property-retrydelay\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"retryDelay?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" | (("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"failureCount"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"error"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function receives a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"retryAttempt"},{"type":"text","value":" integer and the actual Error and returns the delay to apply before the next attempt in milliseconds. A function like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"attempt => Math.min(attempt > 1 ? 2 ** attempt * 1000 : 1000, 30 * 1000)"},{"type":"text","value":" applies exponential backoff. A function like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"attempt => attempt * 1000"},{"type":"text","value":" applies linear backoff. Defaults to a function that applies exponential backoff, capped at